                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I played this game when I was a kid, and revisited in 7th grade for nostalgia purposes. Now, I am in college, and am revisiting it once again.\r\n\r\nI like this silly little puzzle game. Cute artstyle, decent challenges and replayability, with a silly sense of humor, and a nice soundtrack.\r\n\r\nI wish more people knew about this game, as it's always been a bit under the radar for quite a while, even when it first released. Despite this, you won't be disappointed. :D",
